WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:42.400
But I'm in a good mood today.

01:43.000 --> 01:44.120
I'll join you for a while.

01:47.920 --> 01:49.680
Mr. Li, what are you looking at?

02:10.680 --> 02:12.080
Duke Su, please enjoy your tea.

02:12.640 --> 02:13.520
We will

02:15.000 --> 02:15.920
go ahead.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.880
Is it still your treat?

02:25.640 --> 02:26.920
Please help yourself,

02:27.920 --> 02:28.880
Duke Su.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.840
He's just a dog running errands
for His Majesty.

02:43.920 --> 02:45.360
What's there to be cocky of?

02:45.440 --> 02:48.040
Let it go. There's no need to provoke him.

02:48.120 --> 02:50.280
You can bear this insult. But I can't.

02:57.800 --> 02:59.040
Do not provoke him.

03:01.280 --> 03:03.480
My lord, can we really order
whatever we want?

03:05.880 --> 03:06.720
Go ahead.

03:06.800 --> 03:07.640
All right.

03:09.760 --> 03:11.800
Isn't the Ye family of Luyang rich?

03:11.880 --> 03:13.920
You bought your way
into the Imperial Academy.

03:14.000 --> 03:14.840
This painting of mine

03:14.920 --> 03:17.240
is by the former dynasty's artist,
Li Zhaodao's original work,

03:17.320 --> 03:18.400
Pine Shade.

03:18.480 --> 03:19.680
It is priceless.

03:21.040 --> 03:22.120
Everyone, take a look.

03:22.200 --> 03:24.160
He indeed damaged this painting.

03:24.760 --> 03:26.080
You're throwing your weight around

03:26.160 --> 03:27.160
and being unreasonable.

03:27.240 --> 03:28.400
I'm in a great mood today.

03:28.480 --> 03:30.400
If you compensate me 3,000 taels of gold,

03:30.480 --> 03:32.120
I won't pursue this matter.

03:32.200 --> 03:33.400
This is extortion.

03:33.480 --> 03:34.320
Who's that?

03:34.400 --> 03:35.240
Ye Shijie,

03:35.320 --> 03:36.760
the eldest son of Luyang's Ye family.

03:39.280 --> 03:42.160
That means he's the cousin

03:42.760 --> 03:43.600
of Ms. Jiang Li.

03:44.920 --> 03:45.800
Correct.

03:46.520 --> 03:49.000
I guess we've interrupted
the Li brothers from watching the show.

03:50.400 --> 03:52.320
I'm reporting you
to the authorities today.

03:52.400 --> 03:53.240
Take him away!

03:53.800 --> 03:54.960
What are you doing?

03:55.840 --> 03:56.720
Don't touch me!

03:57.520 --> 03:58.360
Wait!

04:00.560 --> 04:01.600
- Excuse me.
- Jiang Li.

04:02.640 --> 04:03.680
Jiang Li.

04:03.760 --> 04:04.800
What?

04:04.880 --> 04:06.520
- Don't go.
- Hold this.

04:13.880 --> 04:16.959
Ms. Jiang Li,
why are you here to join the fuss?

04:17.519 --> 04:18.360
Ms. Meng,

04:19.320 --> 04:21.600
can I take a look at this painting?

04:26.920 --> 04:27.880
Let me see it.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.280
Let me take a look.

04:32.520 --> 04:34.000
FIRST YEAR OF TIANBAO, SPRING
LI ZHAODAO

04:34.080 --> 04:36.040
Master Li's artwork is indeed valuable.

04:36.960 --> 04:38.680
It's priceless for its interesting charm.

04:43.600 --> 04:44.520
However,

04:45.000 --> 04:46.480
this painting is an imitation.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.000
What nonsense are you spouting?

04:48.080 --> 04:49.440
- Is it?
- It's really an imitation.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.840
Look at this painting silk.

04:52.440 --> 04:54.520
In the previous dynasty,
they only produced

04:54.600 --> 04:55.680
coarse and thin silk cloth.

04:56.240 --> 04:58.840
But the silk fabric of this painting
is pristine and delicate.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.440
This is clearly dupioni silk.

05:00.520 --> 05:02.120
Master Li from the previous dynasty

05:02.200 --> 05:03.960
couldn't have used
the dupioni silk of today.

05:04.440 --> 05:06.080
This seal is also fake.

05:06.160 --> 05:08.880
They seldom used stone seals back then.

05:09.600 --> 05:10.760
A former dynasty's seal

05:10.840 --> 05:13.000
would have unique traces
of the seals from that time.

05:13.640 --> 05:15.360
The ends of each stroke in the seal script

05:15.440 --> 05:17.280
would be slightly thicker
than the original one

05:17.360 --> 05:20.080
and the color would be lighter,
appearing yellowish.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.920
But the ends of the strokes in this seal

05:22.000 --> 05:23.360
are all smooth

05:23.440 --> 05:26.040
and the color is reddish,
which is obviously not right.

05:26.880 --> 05:28.360
- She has a point.
- It's an imitation?

05:28.440 --> 05:30.160
- Yes! It isn't right!
- I don't know.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.080
It's reddish.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.400
The color is off.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.760
Give me back the painting.

05:42.080 --> 05:44.400
Forget it. I won't argue with you anymore.

05:44.960 --> 05:47.440
Whether you are talking nonsense
or I was deceived,

05:47.520 --> 05:48.760
I'll find out myself.

05:49.360 --> 05:51.600
But even if this is an imitation,
it has value.

05:52.080 --> 05:54.280
- You damaged my painting.
- She was deceived.

05:55.640 --> 05:57.440
Pay me five taels of gold
and I'll let this go.

05:57.520 --> 05:59.040
- Dream on.
- That's unreasonable.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.640
- Exactly.
- If it weren't for Ms. Jiang Li today,

06:01.720 --> 06:03.400
I would have fallen for your trick.

06:03.480 --> 06:05.760
Ye Shijie, stop spouting nonsense.

06:05.840 --> 06:07.240
When did I try to trick your money?

06:07.320 --> 06:08.760
- You're still denying it.
- So petty.

06:08.840 --> 06:12.200
Come with me to the government office.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.600
Ye Shijie, you'd better not…

06:13.680 --> 06:14.840
Mr. Ye,

06:15.640 --> 06:18.080
this is probably a misunderstanding.

06:18.760 --> 06:22.160
Having been deceived,
Ms. Meng is already unfortunate.

06:22.240 --> 06:25.280
- How about--
- Ms. Jiang Li, you don't need to help her.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.760
She tried to trick me today.

06:27.840 --> 06:29.280
If she doesn't face consequences,

06:29.360 --> 06:31.120
she will trick more people in the future.

06:31.680 --> 06:34.440
Today, I'm not fighting for myself.

06:35.440 --> 06:36.960
I'm upholding a sense of justice.

06:38.200 --> 06:39.520
Justice?

06:40.520 --> 06:43.160
Everyone, take a look.

06:43.240 --> 06:46.160
It was Ye Shijie
who spoke disrespectfully to me

06:46.240 --> 06:47.480
and made unfounded speculations.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.880
- It was you!
- He didn't!

06:48.960 --> 06:50.600
- She slandered him.
- He's slandering me!

06:50.680 --> 06:52.800
You're slandering him
and making a ruckus here.

06:52.880 --> 06:54.040
You're shifting the blame.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.240
- I…
- She's even blaming him.

06:55.320 --> 06:56.440
- Yes.
- I can't live anymore!

06:57.400 --> 06:59.680
- I don't want to live anymore!
- That's enough.

06:59.760 --> 07:00.840
Ms. Meng.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.120
You can't live for this reason?

07:02.200 --> 07:04.120
You'll experience
more grievances in the future.

07:04.200 --> 07:05.640
Won't you have to die 100 times then?

07:06.640 --> 07:07.480
He is also at fault.

07:08.440 --> 07:09.280
Mr. Ye,

07:09.760 --> 07:12.080
you don't show compassion toward a lady.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.840
All you care about is getting out of this.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.560
That's not a gentleman's conduct.

07:15.640 --> 07:16.600
Jiang Jingrui,

07:17.440 --> 07:18.440
give me the money.

07:23.680 --> 07:24.760
I'll buy this painting.

07:25.400 --> 07:27.560
Take it and tear it up to vent your anger.

07:27.640 --> 07:29.840
So no one gets tricked after this.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.320
Here.

07:33.440 --> 07:34.920
Who wants your money?

07:35.440 --> 07:37.360
I'll just give this painting to you all.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.880
Let's go!

07:44.400 --> 07:45.720
What a busybody.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.600
Who are you calling a busybody?

07:50.160 --> 07:53.040
Jiang Li argued with people
on the street to seek attention.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.960
She doesn't have
a Jiang family woman's manners.

07:56.000 --> 07:56.880
I think

07:56.960 --> 07:58.520
Ms. Jiang Li is quite courageous.

07:58.600 --> 07:59.800
Ruoyao,

07:59.880 --> 08:01.360
why don't we consider

08:01.440 --> 08:02.840
teaming up with Ms. Jiang Li?

08:02.920 --> 08:04.440
After all, she's your family.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.040
What do you think?

08:14.240 --> 08:16.800
You can team up with whomever you want.

08:18.960 --> 08:19.800
Ruoyao.

08:19.880 --> 08:21.160
Mr. Zhou.

08:23.640 --> 08:25.040
I told you earlier

08:25.680 --> 08:28.560
that your plan was too childish
and wouldn't work.

08:28.640 --> 08:29.920
If it weren't for Jiang Li,

08:30.480 --> 08:32.360
I would have Ye Shijie under my control.

08:32.440 --> 08:34.200
After I offered him some help,

08:34.760 --> 08:36.360
he would only be grateful to me.

08:39.120 --> 08:40.039
Li Lian,

08:40.720 --> 08:41.640
they are in-laws.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.920
If you don't come up with a plan soon,

08:45.000 --> 08:47.640
Father will really get angry.

08:51.520 --> 08:52.640
I got this.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.680
Don't get yourself involved
in these things from now on.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.320
Meng Hongjin is the daughter

09:04.400 --> 09:06.960
of Meng Youde,
General of Proclaimed Dominance.

09:07.040 --> 09:09.720
If she gets angry,
she'd even dare to bite a dog.

09:09.800 --> 09:11.280
Why didn't you say so earlier?

09:12.320 --> 09:14.040
You've already done him such a huge favor.

09:14.120 --> 09:15.680
You should discuss
the Annual Exam with him.

09:15.760 --> 09:17.960
- No rush.
- There's no hurry?

09:18.040 --> 09:19.840
Fine. Let's see
when you start getting anxious.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.680
Carry this box for me.

09:28.040 --> 09:30.520
Ms. Jiang Li,
his lordship wants to buy you tea.

09:33.840 --> 09:34.800
Duke Su?

09:37.160 --> 09:38.240
Did she do something wrong?

09:38.720 --> 09:41.200
Mr. Jiang, he's just inviting her for tea.

09:41.280 --> 09:42.280
Tea, I see.

09:42.360 --> 09:43.840
Then I'll go with her.

09:43.920 --> 09:44.760
Mr. Jiang.

09:44.840 --> 09:47.040
His lordship is only inviting
Ms. Jiang Li.

09:47.120 --> 09:48.880
There's nothing Duke Su and I
can talk about.

09:48.960 --> 09:49.920
We'll go ahead then.

09:50.400 --> 09:51.360
Excuse us.

09:57.160 --> 09:58.000
Let's go this way.

09:59.320 --> 10:00.160
This way.

10:02.400 --> 10:03.760
- Jiang--
- It's fine.

10:03.840 --> 10:06.600
Listen. I have a bad temper.

10:06.680 --> 10:08.560
- Jiang Jingrui.
- Have some tea with this, dude.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.320
It hurts!

10:11.400 --> 10:12.520
I'll go up now.

10:23.400 --> 10:25.200
Duke Su, what brings you here again?

10:27.880 --> 10:30.240
You're the second person
who asked that question today.

10:47.920 --> 10:48.960
Please have some tea.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.600
I dare not.

10:52.280 --> 10:54.640
I thought I was brought here
to be interrogated.

10:55.360 --> 10:56.840
Don't be so angry,

10:58.080 --> 10:58.920
Li.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.440
Duke Su,

11:06.320 --> 11:09.200
the name "Li" was given by an elder.

11:10.320 --> 11:13.120
We're not close enough
for you to address me as such.

11:14.440 --> 11:17.800
When a civet is caught by the tail,

11:17.880 --> 11:19.960
it looks just like you do now.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.360
I've had my tea.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.280
I'll take my leave.

11:42.200 --> 11:44.840
Duke Su, what's the meaning of this?

11:44.920 --> 11:47.240
Why did you stand up
for Ye Shijie earlier?

11:47.920 --> 11:49.760
Ye Shijie is my cousin.

11:50.760 --> 11:52.240
I must help him when he's in trouble.

11:52.800 --> 11:56.120
I heard this year's Annual Exam requires
students from both schools to team up.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.160
Did you set your eyes on him?

11:59.720 --> 12:01.520
If so, is there a problem?

12:04.240 --> 12:07.440
Shen Yurong is in charge of the exam
by imperial decree.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.360
Do you think

12:10.440 --> 12:12.080
you can make it under his watch?

12:13.040 --> 12:14.360
If I can't,

12:15.360 --> 12:16.280
so what?

12:17.000 --> 12:19.440
Will you accuse him

12:19.520 --> 12:21.440
of favoritism and corruption for me?

12:23.640 --> 12:24.560
You're smart enough.

12:27.000 --> 12:27.920
Ms. Jiang Li,

12:29.320 --> 12:30.920
I heard a story before.

12:32.040 --> 12:33.120
It's pretty interesting.

12:33.680 --> 12:34.640
Do you want to hear it?

12:35.520 --> 12:38.000
It's called Duke Huang of the East Sea.

12:38.600 --> 12:42.600
Duke Huang from the East Sea
gained divine power in his youth.

12:43.200 --> 12:46.520
He tamed wild beasts in the mountains
and was admired by many.

12:48.760 --> 12:50.440
He thought he was unrivaled.

12:52.040 --> 12:54.600
Later on, a big white tiger appeared
in the East Sea.

12:55.720 --> 12:58.920
Duke Huang went to subdue it
but didn't succeed

12:59.760 --> 13:01.120
and was killed instead.

13:04.120 --> 13:06.000
Have you heard of this story?

13:08.840 --> 13:10.680
Duke Su, are you trying to remind me

13:11.760 --> 13:13.000
that the people I face now

13:13.080 --> 13:15.800
are just young snakes and weak tigers

13:15.880 --> 13:17.680
that I luckily subdued?

13:18.240 --> 13:21.040
If I encounter a real fierce tiger
in the future,

13:23.360 --> 13:24.760
I won't escape death either.

13:26.800 --> 13:30.080
Ms. Jiang Li,
I rarely read people's fortunes.

13:30.760 --> 13:32.520
But I'll make an exception today.

13:34.200 --> 13:35.520
The path you're on

13:36.880 --> 13:39.960
has a fierce tiger ahead
and a cliff behind.

13:42.240 --> 13:43.800
I advise you to pause

13:43.880 --> 13:46.560
and think carefully before moving forward.

13:46.640 --> 13:48.080
Who is the real fierce tiger?

13:48.560 --> 13:49.960
You will find out in time.

13:52.000 --> 13:52.840
Xue Li.

13:53.320 --> 13:54.520
I have no choice.

13:55.760 --> 13:57.520
She could crush us

13:57.600 --> 13:59.800
like ants.

14:00.760 --> 14:03.640
Duke Su, you've been an official
for many years.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.080
Have you ever killed a tiger?

14:05.640 --> 14:07.240
What were you thinking when you killed it?

14:08.280 --> 14:11.280
When I raise my blade and bring it down,
I think of nothing.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.040
I think of nothing but seeking justice.

14:16.680 --> 14:17.520
Justice?

14:24.960 --> 14:25.960
It's so ugly.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.160
Try to make do with it.

14:27.640 --> 14:29.120
What does my affairs have to do with you?

14:29.200 --> 14:31.000
Maybe in the future, our methods…

14:33.600 --> 14:35.000
will achieve the same result.

15:04.360 --> 15:05.960
Ms. Jiang Li

15:06.040 --> 15:08.200
stomped on the pastry you gave her.

15:16.880 --> 15:17.720
Well done.

15:19.520 --> 15:21.120
If you want to enjoy the show,

15:22.520 --> 15:23.960
you must first support the actors.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.240
Tong'er.

15:35.080 --> 15:35.920
Tong'er?

15:36.400 --> 15:37.240
Miss.

15:38.280 --> 15:40.400
Miss, why are you back so late?

15:40.480 --> 15:42.800
Something happened after school.

15:42.880 --> 15:44.360
I got into an argument.

15:44.440 --> 15:46.200
The family will probably hear it soon.

15:46.680 --> 15:47.720
Let's make preparations.

15:55.600 --> 15:57.440
Ms. Jiang, Old Madam sent a message

15:57.520 --> 15:58.680
for you to go to Wanfeng Hall.

16:01.560 --> 16:04.560
WANFENG HALL

16:04.640 --> 16:05.520
As her mother,

16:06.120 --> 16:08.720
you can just handle it yourself.

16:09.680 --> 16:11.440
Why drag me into this?

16:11.520 --> 16:12.960
Back then, I had always thought

16:13.040 --> 16:15.800
Li'er should learn etiquette
before attending school.

16:15.880 --> 16:16.960
Li'er knows this.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.960
But I'm worried
she might not accept it willingly

16:20.720 --> 16:22.600
if I were to handle this matter.

16:23.160 --> 16:26.080
Old Madam, she listens to you.

16:26.160 --> 16:29.640
I hope you can teach her
our family's rules and values well.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.240
Ms. Jiang Li is here.

16:36.040 --> 16:37.960
Greetings, Grandmother.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.800
Greetings, Mother.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.880
Li'er, Yu'e said

16:42.960 --> 16:46.040
you argued with Ms. Meng in public today.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.200
Is that true?

16:47.840 --> 16:49.040
Yes, it is true.

16:49.120 --> 16:53.400
Do you know Ms. Meng's father
is the General of Proclaimed Dominance?

16:53.480 --> 16:54.560
Yes, I do.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.000
- Then--
- In that case,

16:56.080 --> 16:57.840
why did you still confront her?

16:57.920 --> 17:00.960
Your actions will put your father
in a difficult position.

17:01.040 --> 17:01.880
Mother,

17:02.360 --> 17:04.760
I don't know how this
has anything to do with Father.

17:04.839 --> 17:06.560
Li'er, you may not be aware.

17:06.640 --> 17:09.520
The General of Proclaimed Dominance
and Chancellor Li are close.

17:10.359 --> 17:12.119
Although they don't seem to interact much,

17:12.760 --> 17:15.200
they have deep connections.

17:16.119 --> 17:17.280
In the imperial court,

17:17.359 --> 17:19.800
Chancellor Li and your father
often have different opinions.

17:20.400 --> 17:22.240
Your actions have now escalated

17:22.319 --> 17:23.880
the tension between them.

17:24.680 --> 17:25.680
Chancellor Li?

17:26.480 --> 17:28.119
Who is the real fierce tiger?

17:28.640 --> 17:30.240
You will find out in time.

17:30.720 --> 17:33.600
The Jiang family has always
had strict family rules.

17:33.680 --> 17:36.680
The most taboo is stirring up trouble.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.400
But that doesn't mean

17:38.480 --> 17:39.920
our children should hide

17:40.000 --> 17:42.240
when they make mistakes or face issues.

17:42.320 --> 17:45.400
But in the capital,
the officialdom is complex

17:45.480 --> 17:46.960
and people are complicated.

17:47.040 --> 17:50.160
Your father has a hard time
navigating around it.

17:50.240 --> 17:54.920
Li'er, you were reckless this time.

17:57.120 --> 17:58.280
Grandmother, please don't be mad.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.600
It was also my fault
for not keeping an eye on Jiang Li.

18:00.680 --> 18:02.840
She is straightforward

18:02.920 --> 18:04.520
and may clash with other students.

18:05.000 --> 18:07.520
I'll make sure to step in
and stop her next time.

18:07.600 --> 18:08.880
You're indeed wrong.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.840
Your sister is new
at the School of Integrity.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.320
She's not familiar with the rules there.

18:12.400 --> 18:14.080
You should have watched out for her.

18:14.160 --> 18:15.440
How could you leave her alone?

18:15.520 --> 18:16.800
Old Madam,

18:16.880 --> 18:20.480
it's also my fault
that Li'er got into this trouble today.

18:21.040 --> 18:23.400
What if Li'er stays with me for a few days

18:23.480 --> 18:24.640
to learn the rules?

18:25.240 --> 18:27.240
I want her to quickly learn

18:27.320 --> 18:29.080
the ways of the capital.

18:33.920 --> 18:34.760
There's no rush.

18:35.560 --> 18:38.040
We still need to listen to Li'er's side.

18:40.560 --> 18:41.400
Grandmother,

18:42.360 --> 18:45.320
I did nothing wrong today.

18:49.720 --> 18:52.080
Years ago, I made a mistake
and was sent to Zhennv Hall.

18:52.760 --> 18:54.840
Yet Father was accused of mistreating me.

18:56.360 --> 18:58.200
I lacked education and was careless.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.880
But people gossiped badly

18:59.960 --> 19:01.320
about Father instead.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.480
By chance,

19:03.560 --> 19:05.360
I recognized that the painting
was fake today,

19:05.440 --> 19:07.800
which disproved the rumors of my ignorance

19:07.880 --> 19:10.200
and restored Father's reputation.

19:10.280 --> 19:11.120
Moreover,

19:11.600 --> 19:14.760
knowing the painting was fake
but not exposing it would be dishonest.

19:15.440 --> 19:17.120
Although I didn't deal with it perfectly,

19:17.600 --> 19:19.120
I didn't harm anyone's dignity.

19:19.600 --> 19:21.080
If I just kept quiet about it,

19:21.640 --> 19:23.440
that'd tarnish
the Jiang family's reputation.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.120
If you put it that way,

19:25.800 --> 19:27.920
you've also considered the bigger picture.

19:31.920 --> 19:32.840
Grandmother,

19:32.920 --> 19:34.720
no matter how eloquent Jiang Li is,

19:34.800 --> 19:37.640
it doesn't change the fact
that she got into an argument in public.

19:38.240 --> 19:40.200
Where are her values
as a Jiang family member?

19:40.280 --> 19:42.960
She almost got into a fight
with someone back then.

19:43.040 --> 19:46.040
Onlookers were pointing fingers
at the Jiang family.

19:46.120 --> 19:48.120
When others were criticizing
the Jiang family,

19:48.720 --> 19:50.200
you just stood by and watched?

19:51.200 --> 19:52.040
I…

19:56.360 --> 19:57.560
I only heard about it.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.840
By the time I arrived,
the crowd had dispersed.

20:01.400 --> 20:04.240
Yu'e, don't take rumors seriously.

20:04.760 --> 20:06.320
How could you relay this to Grandmother?

20:06.400 --> 20:08.400
The rumor is already so unpleasant.

20:08.480 --> 20:11.200
Imagine how much of a spectacle
you made of yourself at the time.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.000
I also heard

20:13.480 --> 20:15.760
that the person Meng Hongjin tricked

20:15.840 --> 20:18.400
is Ye Shijie,
the eldest son of Luyang's Ye family.

20:18.480 --> 20:20.320
They're related.

20:20.880 --> 20:23.000
So it's no wonder
she defended him fervently.

20:23.480 --> 20:26.120
Since they're family
and both studying in the capital,

20:26.200 --> 20:28.280
why has Jiang Li never mentioned him

20:28.360 --> 20:29.880
after returning home all this time?

20:30.440 --> 20:33.400
It seems like our family is deliberately
distancing ourselves from relatives.

20:33.480 --> 20:36.600
Li'er, were you in contact
with the Ye family

20:36.680 --> 20:38.440
even before you returned?

20:41.000 --> 20:42.600
I've never met Ye Shijie.

20:44.160 --> 20:46.440
If Ruoyao hadn't informed me now,

20:47.080 --> 20:48.760
I wouldn't have known he was my cousin.

20:50.040 --> 20:53.160
I didn't expect to unknowingly help
a relative in distress.

20:54.240 --> 20:56.600
Grandmother,
even if my birth mother has passed away,

20:57.120 --> 20:59.200
we're in-laws with the Ye family.

20:59.680 --> 21:02.040
Our relative was in trouble.

21:02.880 --> 21:05.040
If I turned a blind eye
and let my cousin be taken

21:05.120 --> 21:06.960
to the local government office,

21:07.040 --> 21:10.080
what would people think

21:10.720 --> 21:12.040
of the Jiang family's upbringing

21:12.120 --> 21:14.000
as well as Father

21:14.080 --> 21:15.400
if this matter spreads?

21:16.360 --> 21:18.120
Why are you dragging Father into this?

21:18.720 --> 21:19.560
That's right.

21:20.120 --> 21:21.560
You may not know this, my sisters.

21:22.040 --> 21:23.360
A Ministry of Rites official

21:23.440 --> 21:25.360
disrupted his elder brother's funeral
when drunk.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.240
The censors reported it

21:27.320 --> 21:28.960
and said he disregarded
familial relations.

21:29.440 --> 21:31.320
Out of anger, His Majesty
gave him ten floggings.

21:31.880 --> 21:33.920
Being an official,
it's not easy for Father.

21:34.000 --> 21:36.480
If this matter
were blown out of proportion,

21:36.560 --> 21:37.920
what should we do then?

21:38.000 --> 21:40.920
Yu'e, in saying I made a spectacle
of myself earlier,

21:41.000 --> 21:43.920
was I the one who looked like a fool
and who were the spectators?

21:52.920 --> 21:54.360
Li'er has a point.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.880
We owe Li'er a lot

21:55.960 --> 21:58.720
over the last ten years.

22:00.360 --> 22:02.880
I understand

22:02.960 --> 22:04.320
if you resent the family.

22:04.400 --> 22:07.640
I just hope you can forgive and forget.

22:08.360 --> 22:11.680
After all,
you have the Ye family blood in you.

22:11.760 --> 22:13.480
If you're close to your cousin,

22:14.200 --> 22:15.840
there's no need to keep it from us.

22:15.920 --> 22:16.760
Keep it from you?

22:18.360 --> 22:22.080
Are you saying I'm not being honest?

22:22.160 --> 22:24.880
I always believe whatever you say.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.760
Grandmother!

22:28.520 --> 22:29.520
Grandmother.

22:31.160 --> 22:32.160
Grandmother.

22:32.840 --> 22:34.160
Aunt Shuran.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.880
Aunt Shuran,

22:35.960 --> 22:38.440
I was with Jiang Li
when the incident happened today.

22:38.520 --> 22:39.640
I can testify for her.

22:40.360 --> 22:42.880
Jiang Li didn't intend to hide anything.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.280
At first,

22:44.360 --> 22:46.360
she didn't know the people
who were arguing.

22:46.440 --> 22:48.600
She only found out after I told her.

22:48.680 --> 22:51.920
Whether she made a spectacle
of herself or not,

22:53.000 --> 22:55.280
you can open the door, Aunt Shuran,

22:55.360 --> 22:56.760
and hear what people are saying.

22:57.320 --> 22:58.920
Everyone

22:59.000 --> 23:00.560
who was there

23:00.640 --> 23:01.480
praised Jiang Li.

23:01.560 --> 23:03.600
Ms. Jiang Li's reputation outside

23:03.680 --> 23:04.640
is great.

23:07.040 --> 23:09.480
I know you're close with Jiang Li.

23:09.560 --> 23:11.160
You'd naturally take her side.

23:11.880 --> 23:13.880
But as a lady,

23:13.960 --> 23:15.520
we should always watch our conduct.

23:15.600 --> 23:17.640
It's admirable for Jiang Li
to stand up for justice.

23:18.160 --> 23:20.320
But for a lady to interfere
in men's affairs in public

23:20.400 --> 23:22.400
is not elegant and reflects poorly
on our morals.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.600
It reflects poorly on morals?

23:26.240 --> 23:29.680
Yu'e, you're even reasoning out today.

23:29.760 --> 23:31.880
Can you win against Duke Su too?

23:32.760 --> 23:34.680
What does this have to do with Duke Su?

23:34.760 --> 23:36.080
Grandmother, you're not aware.

23:36.760 --> 23:39.360
He praised Jiang Li endlessly.

23:40.080 --> 23:41.520
After the matter was resolved

23:41.600 --> 23:42.960
and we were about to leave,

23:43.040 --> 23:45.280
Duke Su personally sent someone

23:45.360 --> 23:47.920
to invite Jiang Li for tea.

23:50.080 --> 23:51.120
What did he say to you?

23:51.840 --> 23:52.920
What did he say?

23:53.000 --> 23:54.200
Nothing much.

23:55.440 --> 23:57.600
He just complimented me.

23:58.760 --> 24:02.240
Duke Su said,
"Like father, like daughter."

24:02.320 --> 24:04.160
He also sent his regards to Father.

24:05.480 --> 24:06.680
Since that's the case,

24:07.440 --> 24:10.680
it seems today's incident
was not Li'er's fault after all.

24:11.640 --> 24:12.520
All right.

24:12.600 --> 24:14.000
Now that everything is clear,

24:14.080 --> 24:15.520
you can all go back.

24:22.000 --> 24:23.920
The children are young

24:24.000 --> 24:26.000
and are afraid of tarnishing
the family's reputation.

24:26.560 --> 24:28.360
We've disturbed you from resting.

24:29.040 --> 24:30.680
We'll get going now.

24:30.760 --> 24:32.400
We won't disturb you.

24:46.000 --> 24:48.360
Grandmother, I'll take my leave too.

24:48.440 --> 24:50.240
Grandmother, I'm going too.

24:58.080 --> 24:59.680
I was worried at first.

25:00.920 --> 25:05.320
But it seems Li'er is quite clever.

25:08.400 --> 25:09.600
Duke Su sure is useful.

25:11.120 --> 25:12.840
No wonder you told Tong'er

25:12.920 --> 25:15.080
to let me mention Duke Su
in front of Grandmother.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.360
One praise from him

25:18.080 --> 25:19.720
outweighs 100 criticisms from Ji Shuran.

25:22.320 --> 25:24.280
Did Duke Su really praise you?

25:24.360 --> 25:26.560
- No.
- You even dared to lie about that.

25:26.640 --> 25:29.040
If Duke Su finds out later,
he'll surely hold you accountable.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.480
He won't have the time.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.400
Mr. Ye, Mr. Li requests to see you.

25:42.360 --> 25:44.000
- Mr. Li?
- Yes.

25:52.840 --> 25:54.440
I wonder what brings you here, Mr. Li.

25:54.520 --> 25:56.640
I just heard about Meng Hongjin

25:56.720 --> 25:58.120
trying to trick you today.

25:58.200 --> 26:01.040
Mr. Ye, you're neither obsequious
nor arrogant, a true gentleman.

26:01.120 --> 26:03.600
That's why I came here

26:03.680 --> 26:04.640
to make friends.

26:04.720 --> 26:06.000
You're too kind, Mr. Li.

26:07.720 --> 26:09.920
In the past, you only focused
on studying the classics.

26:10.000 --> 26:11.880
I'm afraid you don't know
the ways of the capital.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.680
There are all kinds of people here.

26:13.760 --> 26:16.600
Without a strong support network,
one may fall victim to schemes.

26:17.160 --> 26:19.680
I'll be frank. I really admire you.

26:19.760 --> 26:21.320
If you're willing to be our friend,

26:21.400 --> 26:22.920
we'll ensure your safety.

26:23.000 --> 26:25.600
From now on,
apart from the Imperial Academy,

26:25.680 --> 26:27.080
the whole capital city

26:28.120 --> 26:29.680
won't dare to offend you anymore.

26:29.760 --> 26:33.080
Are you suggesting that we team up
for the upcoming exams?

26:33.160 --> 26:34.040
Yes.

26:34.760 --> 26:36.000
Those at the Imperial Academy

26:36.080 --> 26:37.760
aim to be successful and become officials.

26:37.840 --> 26:38.880
Once they achieve that,

26:38.960 --> 26:41.560
navigating political circles
becomes a skill.

26:41.640 --> 26:43.000
Mr. Shen is wise

26:43.080 --> 26:44.760
to reform the system,

26:45.360 --> 26:46.760
giving us a chance

26:46.840 --> 26:49.040
to learn how to become officials here.

26:49.600 --> 26:50.600
Think about it.

26:50.680 --> 26:53.160
If you join us and we get first place
and meet His Majesty,

26:53.240 --> 26:56.040
it'll not only secure your future
but also let you study without worries

26:56.120 --> 26:58.240
and help you take care
of any unnecessary troubles.

26:58.800 --> 26:59.720
What do you think?

27:03.640 --> 27:04.680
There's no rush.

27:05.240 --> 27:06.600
You can give me an answer tomorrow.

27:07.880 --> 27:08.800
I'll take my leave now.

27:15.280 --> 27:17.840
YE RESIDENCE

27:30.360 --> 27:31.200
Ms. Jiang Li.

27:33.040 --> 27:33.960
Yes?

27:34.040 --> 27:35.320
The Annual Exam is approaching.

27:35.400 --> 27:37.000
I heard you still haven't formed a team.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.200
Thank you for your concern.

27:38.880 --> 27:39.760
It's indeed true.

27:40.320 --> 27:42.000
We were betrothed once,

27:42.080 --> 27:43.280
so our fates were intertwined.

27:43.880 --> 27:45.760
I'm impressed with your experiences.

27:45.840 --> 27:48.240
It's a pity if someone
as talented as you are is expelled

27:48.320 --> 27:49.800
right after entering the academy.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.920
Emotionally and logically,

27:51.400 --> 27:52.560
I should lend you a hand.

27:52.640 --> 27:54.800
Have you asked Ruoyao's opinion?

27:54.880 --> 27:58.240
If you're willing, I'll persuade Ruoyao.

27:59.080 --> 28:01.680
SURPASS VIRTUE AND KNOWLEDGE

28:01.760 --> 28:02.600
Mr. Zhou,

28:03.640 --> 28:04.560
aren't you

28:04.640 --> 28:06.640
teaming up with my other two cousins?

28:07.240 --> 28:08.920
Now, you're trying to get Jiang Li.

28:09.000 --> 28:10.600
Which one are you planning

28:10.680 --> 28:12.080
to push out?

28:12.160 --> 28:13.800
Or are you just being greedy

28:13.880 --> 28:14.920
and wanting both of them?

28:15.000 --> 28:16.600
I'm just trying to help Ms. Jiang Li.

28:17.160 --> 28:19.720
Besides, my marriage
with Jiang Ruoyao isn't set in stone yet.

28:19.800 --> 28:20.760
How about this?

28:20.840 --> 28:22.200
Go home now

28:22.280 --> 28:24.480
and break off your engagement
with Jiang Ruoyao,

28:24.560 --> 28:26.080
then get back with Jiang Li.

28:26.160 --> 28:27.760
When that happens, you can naturally

28:28.440 --> 28:29.600
form a team.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.760
Jiang Jingrui,

28:31.320 --> 28:32.160
you're going too far.

28:32.840 --> 28:34.080
I just said

28:34.160 --> 28:35.320
what's on your mind.

28:35.400 --> 28:38.520
Go home and ask your parents

28:38.600 --> 28:40.360
if they'll let you break
another engagement.

28:41.360 --> 28:42.640
Jiang Li, let's go.

28:43.120 --> 28:43.960
Ignore him.

28:50.160 --> 28:52.920
SURPASS VIRTUE AND KNOWLEDGE

28:55.520 --> 28:57.200
Mr. Ye!

28:58.960 --> 29:00.440
Is my favor a grievance?

29:00.520 --> 29:01.760
What do you mean?

29:02.320 --> 29:03.640
I helped you.

29:03.720 --> 29:05.120
Yet you keep avoiding me.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.280
What are you afraid of?

29:07.240 --> 29:09.560
- That I'd want you to return the favor?
- What do you want?

29:09.640 --> 29:10.840
Buy me some tea.

29:10.920 --> 29:12.040
I refuse.

29:12.120 --> 29:14.320
I'll wait for you at the tea house
after school.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.840
I heard about how you taught Meng Hongjin

29:21.920 --> 29:23.000
a lesson yesterday.

29:23.080 --> 29:23.920
So?

29:24.760 --> 29:26.840
I thought you were useless like them,

29:26.920 --> 29:29.240
who bully the weak and fear the strong.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.760
I didn't expect you to have some guts.

29:32.600 --> 29:34.360
It makes me want to get
to know you better.

29:36.760 --> 29:37.640
I'm Liu Xu.

29:37.720 --> 29:39.960
If you face any trouble at school,
just mention my name.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.040
I'll protect you.

29:43.760 --> 29:44.600
Thank you.

29:46.200 --> 29:48.200
I heard you haven't formed a team yet.

29:48.840 --> 29:51.160
Me neither. How about we team up?

29:51.240 --> 29:52.080
The two of us?

29:52.840 --> 29:55.360
With your dim-witted cousin?

29:56.600 --> 29:57.760
Our chance of winning is slim.

29:59.040 --> 30:00.360
What if we add Ye Shijie?

30:06.760 --> 30:07.600
Ye Shijie?

30:09.080 --> 30:10.480
From the Ye family of Luyang?

30:11.240 --> 30:12.080
Yes.

30:13.480 --> 30:16.800
He does have some knowledge.

30:16.880 --> 30:18.560
But is he willing to join our team?

30:19.160 --> 30:20.880
I'm not sure.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.320
But we should give it a try.

30:31.840 --> 30:33.000
Miss. This way, please.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.840
I waited for an hour.

30:43.320 --> 30:47.560
FORBEARANCE

30:47.640 --> 30:49.840
A lady should dress up
before an appointment.

30:50.520 --> 30:52.040
I'm already quick enough.

30:54.240 --> 30:55.200
Consider the tea on me.

30:55.280 --> 30:56.760
Have as much as you like.

30:56.840 --> 30:57.920
Cousin.

31:01.640 --> 31:03.400
Let's stick to formalities.

31:03.480 --> 31:05.040
We are a family.

31:05.600 --> 31:07.360
But why do you always keep me
at arm's length?

31:09.960 --> 31:12.720
Ms. Jiang Li, you're a high-born lady

31:12.800 --> 31:14.240
and I'm a merchant's son.

31:14.320 --> 31:15.640
I don't deserve

31:16.360 --> 31:17.720
to be called your cousin.

31:17.800 --> 31:18.680
Why?

31:18.760 --> 31:20.760
Remember what you said

31:20.840 --> 31:22.160
when Grandmother came to fetch you

31:22.760 --> 31:23.920
from the capital years ago?

31:24.480 --> 31:25.320
THIRTEEN YEARS AGO

31:25.400 --> 31:28.320
Jiang Li. Little Jiang Li,
it must be hard on you.

31:28.400 --> 31:31.120
Come here and let me hug you.

31:37.640 --> 31:41.040
Come, go home with me.

31:41.120 --> 31:43.440
I won't go anywhere. This is my home!

31:43.520 --> 31:46.320
Isn't my home also your home?

31:46.880 --> 31:49.040
No, you're not my family!

31:49.120 --> 31:51.400
Li, how could you say such a thing?

31:51.480 --> 31:53.200
My mother is standing right here.

31:53.280 --> 31:54.640
I'm the Jiang family's daughter.

31:54.720 --> 31:56.120
I don't want to be
a merchant's family member.

31:56.200 --> 31:57.120
I'm not going with you.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.720
Jiang Li, you should come with me.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.920
- Come home with me.
- No!

32:01.000 --> 32:03.240
Mother.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.480
Mother.

32:06.560 --> 32:07.600
Mother!

32:07.680 --> 32:09.720
After Grandmother reached home,
she fell seriously ill

32:10.360 --> 32:12.080
and had to recuperate for a whole year.

32:12.920 --> 32:14.760
Father took this to heart for many years.

32:15.480 --> 32:18.840
And now, you're here claiming kinship.

32:20.240 --> 32:21.320
How can I trust you?

32:21.880 --> 32:25.080
Is this why the Jiang and Ye families
stopped keeping in touch?

32:25.160 --> 32:26.640
Would we dare to keep in touch?

32:30.600 --> 32:31.680
What are you doing?

32:31.760 --> 32:33.240
Shijie, let me explain first.

32:33.840 --> 32:36.160
There's something I've been keeping
to myself for many years.

32:37.480 --> 32:39.720
I've always wanted
to tell Grandmother myself

32:39.800 --> 32:41.880
- but never had a chance--
- I don't need your excuses.

32:41.960 --> 32:42.840
It's not.

32:43.800 --> 32:44.960
I may be young back then,

32:45.040 --> 32:46.760
but I wasn't a heartless person.

32:48.040 --> 32:49.880
In front of Grandmother and all of you,

32:50.840 --> 32:52.520
I thought what I did protected

32:52.600 --> 32:54.360
the Jiang family and my father.

32:55.200 --> 32:57.080
Little did I know, I was just naive

32:57.640 --> 32:59.000
and unknowingly manipulated.

33:02.080 --> 33:05.920
Tong'er, tell me everything you know.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.440
I want to know

33:07.520 --> 33:09.240
Li'er's situation with the Ye family then.

33:10.600 --> 33:12.360
During her ten years at Zhennv Hall,

33:12.880 --> 33:14.360
her ladyship always regretted

33:14.440 --> 33:15.600
what she did back then.

33:18.360 --> 33:19.560
Look, your mother's there.

33:24.720 --> 33:26.120
Mother, what's wrong?

33:28.160 --> 33:29.000
Li'er.

33:29.880 --> 33:31.120
Li'er, you're here.

33:32.600 --> 33:33.640
Li'er, tell me.

33:35.080 --> 33:36.480
How have I been treating you?

33:36.560 --> 33:39.360
You are very nice to me.

33:46.480 --> 33:48.640
I've raised you since you were little.

33:49.320 --> 33:50.960
I've always favored you.

33:52.160 --> 33:54.560
Even Ruoyao wears hand-me-downs from you.

33:55.360 --> 33:56.520
However,

33:56.600 --> 33:58.520
how can I withstand

33:59.480 --> 34:01.280
the idle gossip from outsiders?

34:01.920 --> 34:02.880
What did they say?

34:04.440 --> 34:05.400
I…

34:07.360 --> 34:08.400
I…

34:08.880 --> 34:10.199
Mother, what's wrong?

34:10.760 --> 34:11.840
Ms. Jiang Li,

34:12.520 --> 34:15.080
your maternal grandmother
is here to pick you up.

34:16.159 --> 34:17.480
There are rumors outside

34:18.280 --> 34:21.800
that Madam Ji mistreats you.

34:21.880 --> 34:23.080
Such things

34:23.159 --> 34:26.400
really break Madam Ji's heart.

34:28.199 --> 34:30.520
That's why Madam Ji fell ill

34:30.600 --> 34:33.080
from such slander.

34:33.159 --> 34:35.560
Could there be some misunderstanding?

34:36.159 --> 34:37.760
Don't blame me for being harsh.

34:38.440 --> 34:40.360
What kind of household
is the Ye family of Luyang?

34:40.440 --> 34:41.520
They're merchants.

34:41.600 --> 34:43.520
Do you think they genuinely
want to take you back?

34:43.600 --> 34:44.960
They just want to control you

34:45.040 --> 34:47.480
and leverage
his lordship's official position

34:47.560 --> 34:49.840
for their business in the future, right?

34:51.760 --> 34:57.440
People say it's hard to be a stepmother.

34:58.360 --> 35:00.280
If you go with that Ye family,

35:00.360 --> 35:02.120
it will confirm the slander

35:02.200 --> 35:04.520
against Madam Ji.

35:04.600 --> 35:06.000
Those are gossip!

35:06.080 --> 35:12.320
They're just trying
to push Madam Ji to die.

35:12.400 --> 35:14.160
Mother, don't be angry.

35:14.240 --> 35:15.720
I won't go anywhere.

35:15.800 --> 35:17.080
The Jiang family is my home.

35:17.160 --> 35:19.480
I won't let anyone bully Mother.

35:22.160 --> 35:24.920
This is heart-wrenching.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.480
I was still little then.

35:28.360 --> 35:30.280
I foolishly believed their words

35:30.840 --> 35:33.000
and viewed the Ye family as evil people.

35:33.560 --> 35:35.880
How was your life
in the Jiang family afterward?

35:35.960 --> 35:37.480
How did your stepmother treat you?

35:37.560 --> 35:39.440
She was meticulous indeed.

35:40.280 --> 35:42.920
She's always kind to me
in public and private.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.920
If I didn't want to study,
I didn't have to.

35:45.000 --> 35:47.000
I didn't have to practice calligraphy
if I didn't want to.

35:47.560 --> 35:50.000
If I didn't want to do embroidery,
I didn't have to.

35:50.080 --> 35:51.600
She even covered up my mistakes

35:52.360 --> 35:53.480
and allowed me

35:53.560 --> 35:55.160
to become more and more arrogant at home.

35:56.120 --> 35:57.160
You mean…

35:57.760 --> 35:58.960
Destruction through flattery.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.600
That's just your side of the story.

36:03.160 --> 36:04.560
You're telling me all this now

36:04.640 --> 36:06.640
because you want to reconcile
with the Ye family

36:07.640 --> 36:09.160
and not offend the Meng family, right?

36:11.600 --> 36:14.280
So you're upset with me
because of this incident.

36:15.520 --> 36:16.880
Are you blaming me

36:16.960 --> 36:18.760
for not sending Meng Hongjin
to the authorities

36:18.840 --> 36:19.880
and giving her a way out?

36:19.960 --> 36:21.000
Isn't that what you did?

36:23.440 --> 36:24.960
I didn't want to give her a way out.

36:26.120 --> 36:27.560
It's just that in the capital,

36:27.640 --> 36:28.920
there are various powers at play.

36:30.120 --> 36:31.840
Even though the Ye family is wealthy,

36:31.920 --> 36:33.840
lacking officials in the family

36:34.320 --> 36:37.760
makes you vulnerable.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.680
In a joint state-private business,

36:39.760 --> 36:41.400
officials have authority over merchants.

36:41.960 --> 36:43.760
Giving Meng Hongjin a way out

36:43.840 --> 36:44.880
is also for your own good.

36:45.440 --> 36:47.800
If you kept pushing and causing a fallout,

36:47.880 --> 36:49.920
the Meng family
would seek a death warrant.

36:51.040 --> 36:52.640
You're a smart person.

36:52.720 --> 36:53.880
You were just upset yesterday.

36:53.960 --> 36:55.360
That's why I dare to remind you of this.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.680
I understand that.

36:57.840 --> 37:00.240
Otherwise,
I wouldn't have let her off this time.

37:03.160 --> 37:04.680
What is the meaning of this?

37:04.760 --> 37:06.680
I never like owing any favors.

37:07.640 --> 37:09.520
This is my gratitude
for your help yesterday.

37:10.080 --> 37:11.680
Your way of expressing thanks

37:11.760 --> 37:13.440
is indeed characteristic of the Ye family.

37:14.120 --> 37:15.600
You're a family of merchants.

37:15.680 --> 37:16.520
But I am not.

37:17.000 --> 37:19.240
If my desire to uphold justice
becomes a transaction,

37:19.320 --> 37:21.480
wouldn't I also become
someone like Meng Hongjin?

37:22.520 --> 37:23.520
Return it in another way.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.360
What do you have in mind?

37:25.440 --> 37:26.320
Team up with me

37:26.960 --> 37:28.360
and help me pass the Annual Exam.

37:30.600 --> 37:31.440
Well…

37:31.520 --> 37:33.480
It shouldn't be difficult for you, right?

37:33.560 --> 37:34.560
To be honest,

37:35.720 --> 37:36.760
Li Lian approached me.

37:38.200 --> 37:41.040
Li Lian, the son of Li Zhongnan?

37:41.680 --> 37:42.520
Yes.

37:42.600 --> 37:45.080
Do you know the relationship
between Meng Hongjin and Li Lian?

37:45.160 --> 37:46.200
Do I need to know?

37:46.280 --> 37:48.960
Meng Hongjin's father,
General of Proclaimed Dominance,

37:49.040 --> 37:51.080
has a close relationship with Li Zhongnan.

37:51.720 --> 37:53.360
The two families have deep ties.

37:53.440 --> 37:56.160
Perhaps Li Lian and Meng Hongjin
are already acquainted.

37:56.760 --> 37:57.920
We can't speculate about this.

37:58.000 --> 37:59.440
When did Li Lian approach you?

37:59.520 --> 38:01.200
It was after Meng Hongjin caused trouble.

38:01.280 --> 38:02.520
That makes sense.

38:02.600 --> 38:03.880
What do you mean?

38:03.960 --> 38:07.360
I'm guessing he said
that if you joined his team,

38:07.440 --> 38:10.120
similar incidents
wouldn't happen to you again.

38:10.200 --> 38:11.200
How did you know?

38:11.280 --> 38:12.480
In that case,

38:12.560 --> 38:14.560
Li Lian was behind Meng Hongjin's plot.

38:15.520 --> 38:16.440
Shijie,

38:16.520 --> 38:20.120
their original plan was to use
Meng Hongjin to give you a hard time,

38:20.200 --> 38:21.680
then come to your aid

38:21.760 --> 38:23.680
when you're helpless against Ms. Meng.

38:23.760 --> 38:25.920
They just want to recruit you.

38:26.000 --> 38:29.320
But they didn't expect me to show up.

38:30.960 --> 38:32.080
Are you telling me this

38:33.240 --> 38:35.320
to form a team with you

38:37.280 --> 38:38.520
so you can pass the exam?

38:38.600 --> 38:40.680
I want to establish myself
in the School of Integrity.

38:41.760 --> 38:42.880
But what I want most

38:42.960 --> 38:44.160
is for the Ye family to know

38:44.240 --> 38:45.800
the real Jiang Li.

38:46.720 --> 38:48.120
When I was little, I was deceived

38:48.200 --> 38:49.680
and broke Grandmother's heart.

38:49.760 --> 38:50.760
The truth is…

38:52.200 --> 38:53.160
family

38:54.200 --> 38:55.600
is most important to me.

39:03.600 --> 39:05.160
Thank you for the tea, Shijie.

39:07.440 --> 39:08.280
Jiang Li.

39:12.200 --> 39:13.080
I'll join you.

39:30.920 --> 39:33.120
Has General Meng's side
been taken care of?

39:34.440 --> 39:35.680
Don't worry, dear.

39:36.360 --> 39:37.880
We sent clothes to Mrs. Meng.

39:38.600 --> 39:39.880
They also gave gifts in return.

39:40.640 --> 39:45.040
The issue between Li'er and Meng Hongjin
is considered settled.

39:45.120 --> 39:48.880
I originally thought Li'er would get
picked on at the School of Integrity.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.240
I didn't expect her

39:51.320 --> 39:53.360
to have such courage.

39:53.920 --> 39:54.760
Dear,

39:56.040 --> 39:58.040
you have always been cautious in court.

39:58.920 --> 40:00.960
Descendants of high-ranking officials
and nobles study

40:01.440 --> 40:03.560
in the School of Integrity
and the Imperial Academy.

40:04.200 --> 40:07.480
The argument between Li'er
and Meng Hongjin is not a concern.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.240
But I fear that if we let this go,

40:10.040 --> 40:12.680
it might cause trouble
with nobles in the future

40:12.760 --> 40:13.680
and drag you down.

40:15.000 --> 40:16.800
You're being overly cautious.

40:16.880 --> 40:19.000
It's just a dispute
among younger generations.

40:19.880 --> 40:22.440
As a Chancellor,

40:22.520 --> 40:24.640
I wouldn't be bogged down by such matters.

40:25.280 --> 40:27.120
Li'er had a unique experience.

40:27.200 --> 40:28.360
Don't you remember

40:29.160 --> 40:31.600
why we brought her back initially?

40:32.840 --> 40:35.040
When some matters are talked about,

40:35.120 --> 40:36.720
they can reach His Majesty's ears.

40:38.760 --> 40:40.200
Dear, you worry too much.

40:41.760 --> 40:44.760
If Li'er makes a big mistake,

40:45.640 --> 40:47.920
I will certainly discipline her.

40:52.200 --> 40:56.080
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

41:00.440 --> 41:01.280
Come here.

41:05.600 --> 41:07.920
Did Ye Shijie really agree
to join our team?

41:08.000 --> 41:09.840
You seem to care about him a lot.

41:09.920 --> 41:11.400
I'm just concerned about you.

41:13.920 --> 41:15.400
Don't go.

41:16.000 --> 41:16.840
Did he agree?

41:17.680 --> 41:19.080
You can ask him yourself later.

41:24.120 --> 41:24.960
Jiang Li!

41:28.880 --> 41:30.440
I've been asking around all the morning.

41:30.520 --> 41:32.720
Everyone at the Imperial Academy
has formed teams already.

41:32.800 --> 41:34.880
Now, apart from you, me, and Ye Shijie,

41:34.960 --> 41:36.120
we're short one person.

41:36.200 --> 41:37.880
We must get someone
from the School of Integrity.

41:46.040 --> 41:49.000
Aren't you the one who caused trouble
on the first day of school,

41:50.040 --> 41:51.680
got into a fight,

41:52.280 --> 41:53.920
and even slept in class?

41:55.360 --> 41:56.680
The one who ignores me,

41:56.760 --> 41:59.680
the daughter of
the Vice Minister of Revenue, Liu Xu?

42:03.920 --> 42:04.760
Jiang Jingrui.

42:04.840 --> 42:07.200
Jiang Li, even if we need to fill a spot,

42:07.880 --> 42:08.800
we shouldn't pick her.

42:08.880 --> 42:09.760
Jiang Jingrui.

42:12.160 --> 42:14.400
Jiang Li, don't blame me
for not warning you.

42:14.480 --> 42:15.960
If you want to pass the Annual Exam,

42:16.040 --> 42:17.360
choose your team member carefully.

42:18.680 --> 42:22.280
Bringing in someone who talks big

42:22.360 --> 42:24.360
but lacks substance

42:24.440 --> 42:25.760
will only bring trouble.

42:32.960 --> 42:36.360
But don't worry, Ms. Liu.

42:36.440 --> 42:41.320
I'll surely do everything I can
to make up for your shortcomings.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.800
What shortcomings?

42:44.440 --> 42:45.360
We're classmates.

42:46.240 --> 42:47.240
I won't make it obvious.

42:50.440 --> 42:52.600
Jiang Jingrui,
have I been too nice to you?

42:54.400 --> 42:56.360
Woman! You're hurting me.

42:56.440 --> 42:57.400
All right. Let me go.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.160
Let go.

43:04.320 --> 43:05.280
Come on. Let go.

43:07.160 --> 43:08.360
It hurts.

43:08.440 --> 43:10.320
Let go, girl!

43:16.920 --> 43:19.000
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

43:31.920 --> 43:32.880
Mr. Ye,

43:36.440 --> 43:37.280
you're here.

43:47.040 --> 43:48.760
She really kills subtly.

43:51.200 --> 43:52.040
What happened to you?

43:55.000 --> 43:55.840
It's nothing.

44:00.080 --> 44:00.960
Ye Shijie.

44:06.640 --> 44:08.640
I didn't expect you to reject Mr. Li

44:08.720 --> 44:13.600
and join this team of worthless people.

44:24.080 --> 44:26.800
Are we worthless people

44:26.880 --> 44:30.080
or are you a motley crew?

44:30.160 --> 44:31.400
What did you say?

44:31.480 --> 44:33.720
Meng Hongjin,
can't you even express yourself clearly?

44:33.800 --> 44:35.040
I don't want to talk

44:35.120 --> 44:36.280
to motley crews like you.

44:37.280 --> 44:38.200
Ye Shijie,

44:38.280 --> 44:39.680
there's still time to join us

44:39.760 --> 44:41.280
if you leave them now.

44:41.840 --> 44:44.280
You'll surely get a part
of His Majesty's reward.

44:45.480 --> 44:47.200
I'm thankful
that Mr. Li thinks highly of me.

44:47.280 --> 44:48.880
But I've already said yes to Jiang Li,

44:48.960 --> 44:50.360
so I can't do so.

44:51.000 --> 44:52.640
Haven't you heard

44:52.720 --> 44:55.200
about Jiang Li's dirty deeds
at the Zhennv Hall?

44:55.760 --> 44:58.480
Aren't you worried
that being with a tainted person like her

44:58.560 --> 44:59.640
would tarnish your reputation?

44:59.720 --> 45:00.760
Meng Hongjin,

45:01.880 --> 45:03.520
the people here are sensible

45:04.040 --> 45:05.680
and what is taught here is virtue.

45:05.760 --> 45:08.920
It's shameful of you to spread rumors
and cause trouble.

45:09.680 --> 45:10.520
Apologize.

45:12.040 --> 45:12.880
Apologize!

45:13.880 --> 45:14.840
What a joke.

45:14.920 --> 45:16.840
Why should I apologize to you people

45:16.920 --> 45:19.160
who are about to be expelled
from the school?

45:20.360 --> 45:22.920
Ye Shijie, even if you're capable,

45:23.000 --> 45:24.400
they'll only drag you down

45:24.480 --> 45:25.880
if you team up with them.

45:31.280 --> 45:32.920
You might be disappointed this time.

45:33.000 --> 45:35.040
We'll be judged
based on the team's performance.

45:35.520 --> 45:36.800
With Mr. Ye here,

45:36.880 --> 45:38.200
we won't be that far behind.

45:38.760 --> 45:41.520
Is that so? How about a bet?

45:41.600 --> 45:43.280
If you're eliminated,

45:44.480 --> 45:45.320
Ye Shijie,

45:45.400 --> 45:48.520
publicly kneel and apologize to me.

45:48.600 --> 45:50.640
Meng Hongjin, are you out of your mind?

45:51.920 --> 45:54.280
Are you imitating Jiang Li
for speaking out for justice?

45:54.360 --> 45:57.280
Her father is a Chancellor.
What about you?

45:58.200 --> 46:00.680
Meng Hongjin, listen here.

46:00.760 --> 46:03.200
If you keep being unreasonable,

46:03.920 --> 46:07.520
my iron fist might land on a woman.

46:27.440 --> 46:29.200
I know you won't dare to agree.

46:29.760 --> 46:31.200
What a bunch of cowards.

46:33.240 --> 46:34.320
I'll make that bet with you.

46:36.240 --> 46:37.720
- He agreed.
- Yes.

46:55.000 --> 46:55.960
Since it's a bet,

46:56.880 --> 46:58.480
then the condition should be mutual.

46:58.560 --> 47:00.200
If we're not eliminated,

47:00.720 --> 47:01.560
then you

47:02.040 --> 47:04.560
will kneel and apologize to Jiang Li.

47:06.840 --> 47:07.880
What's the matter?

47:07.960 --> 47:08.800
Are you scared?

47:08.880 --> 47:10.480
Not at all.

47:10.560 --> 47:12.080
You just provoked me.

47:12.640 --> 47:13.960
Here's a new bet.

47:14.040 --> 47:15.360
If you're eliminated,

47:15.960 --> 47:17.560
all of you

47:17.640 --> 47:19.000
will kneel and apologize to me.

47:19.080 --> 47:20.280
- Apologize!
- Apologize!

47:20.360 --> 47:21.480
This is between us.

47:21.560 --> 47:22.760
It has nothing to do with them.

47:22.840 --> 47:23.720
Don't go too far.

47:23.800 --> 47:26.000
Weren't you just standing up
for justice earlier?

47:26.080 --> 47:27.320
What's the matter?

47:27.400 --> 47:29.320
Can't you bear seeing
your cousin kneel before me?

47:31.160 --> 47:32.000
Shijie.

47:34.560 --> 47:36.680
Since you involved us all,

47:36.760 --> 47:39.320
how can we exclude the Li brothers?

47:40.200 --> 47:41.200
If we get eliminated,

47:41.280 --> 47:42.840
we can kneel.

47:43.400 --> 47:45.960
But if we're not eliminated,

47:46.040 --> 47:48.880
you and the Li brothers

47:49.440 --> 47:52.400
will kneel and apologize.

47:52.480 --> 47:53.880
How bold!

47:53.960 --> 47:55.680
We won't bet with you if we're not bold.

47:57.120 --> 48:01.080
This time, you've dragged
the Li brothers into this bet.

48:02.080 --> 48:04.880
Our bet is so grand that we could start

48:04.960 --> 48:06.320
a betting counter here.

48:07.320 --> 48:09.640
You're a bunch of lunatics.

48:09.720 --> 48:10.960
I don't want to argue with you.

48:13.080 --> 48:15.200
Why do I hear someone talking about me?

48:16.560 --> 48:17.440
It's…

48:18.000 --> 48:19.040
Mr. Li is here.

48:29.360 --> 48:30.200
Mr. Li.

48:32.680 --> 48:33.680
You have no idea

48:33.760 --> 48:35.280
how out of line they are.

48:35.920 --> 48:37.080
They wanted to bet with us.

48:37.160 --> 48:39.680
And if we lose, we must all kneel to them.

48:39.760 --> 48:40.840
Meng Hongjin,

48:40.920 --> 48:42.640
you're really good at playing the victim.

48:43.280 --> 48:45.200
We're all fellow students.

48:45.280 --> 48:46.760
There's no need for all this kneeling.

48:46.840 --> 48:49.520
It wouldn't sound good if word got out.

48:50.240 --> 48:51.960
Mr. Li, you are reasonable.

48:52.480 --> 48:53.680
However,

48:53.760 --> 48:56.440
you should manage your teammate.

48:58.000 --> 48:59.240
I just learned

49:00.040 --> 49:03.680
that this whole bet started because
Ms. Jiang Li stayed at Zhennv Hall.

49:04.520 --> 49:06.160
So it's not really anyone else's fault.

49:06.920 --> 49:08.480
Since everyone is so eager to bet,

49:09.080 --> 49:09.960
let's do it this way.

49:10.680 --> 49:12.240
Both of our teams will compete.

49:13.160 --> 49:14.400
If you lose,

49:14.480 --> 49:17.640
Ms. Jiang Li will return
to Zhennv Hall herself.

49:24.920 --> 49:25.840
Return to Zhennv Hall?

49:26.360 --> 49:28.120
Meng Hongjin started this.

49:28.600 --> 49:29.680
Why should Jiang Li go back?

49:29.760 --> 49:30.760
How about this?

49:31.280 --> 49:32.280
If we lose,

49:33.120 --> 49:36.520
I, Li Lian, will become a monk.

49:46.200 --> 49:47.120
Jiang Li.

49:47.880 --> 49:49.840
From now on, you are me

49:49.920 --> 49:50.760
and I am you.

49:52.040 --> 49:54.720
No one can make decisions
for us from now on.

49:56.000 --> 49:57.920
No one can easily send us away.

49:58.560 --> 50:00.040
Everything started at Zhennv Hall.

50:00.840 --> 50:02.200
I'll take you away from here

50:02.280 --> 50:05.000
and we'll never come back.

50:07.640 --> 50:08.600
Mr. Li,

50:09.160 --> 50:10.960
this is between Ms. Meng and me.

50:11.440 --> 50:13.200
There's no need to involve you and others.

50:13.760 --> 50:14.800
Mr. Ye,

50:14.880 --> 50:17.200
if you change your mind and join my team,

50:17.760 --> 50:18.720
the bet just now

50:21.200 --> 50:22.440
will be canceled.

50:27.000 --> 50:29.400
You've been an official for many years.
Have you ever killed a tiger?

50:30.200 --> 50:31.680
What were you thinking when you killed it?

50:32.280 --> 50:33.480
When I raise my blade and bring it down,

50:34.240 --> 50:35.360
I think of nothing.

50:38.920 --> 50:40.320
There's no need to cancel it.

50:43.640 --> 50:44.760
I'll accept

50:45.720 --> 50:46.560
the bet.

50:47.360 --> 50:48.200
Good.

50:49.360 --> 50:50.480
A promise…

50:51.040 --> 50:52.240
Must be honored.

51:06.200 --> 51:09.280
PROMOTE NOBLE MORALS
AND IDEAS, EXTENSIVE LEARNING

51:09.360 --> 51:12.480
UNYIELDING DEDICATION, EXPLORE
THE RATIONALE AND NATURE OF THINGS
